m4-firmware: firmware files for the owner's own Apple M4 MacBook, extracted from the owner's macOS installation:
- brcm/brcmfmac4388c0-pcie.apple,hostomel*  BCM4388 Wi-Fi firmware, CLM, TX cap, signature and NVRAM (provenance and sha256 per file:
  /usr/share/licenses/m4-firmware/brcmfmac-provenance.json)
- brcm/brcmbt4388c2-apple,hostomel-{a,u}.{bin,ptb}  BCM4388 Bluetooth patches
- apple/aop-als-cal.bin  ambient light sensor calibration
- apple/isp_2224_01XX.dat  front camera (IMX958) setfile
- apple/tpmtfw-j616s.bin  trackpad (MTP) firmware
They are Apple's / Broadcom's proprietary data. They are installed so the drivers of this machine can load them; they are not to be
redistributed outside the owner's own machine. regulatory.db is owned by the wireless-regdb package and is not shipped here.
